        "desc": "A dracolisk can use its breath weapon as an attack. Its breath characteristics are determined by its draconic background, as summarized on the table. Regardless of the type of breath weapon involved, targets in the area of effect take half damage with a successful DC 16 Dex saving throw. Lines are 5 feet wide."
