    "senses": "Darkvision 60 ft.  LEGENDARY ACTIONS The sea serpent can take up to three legendary actions per round. Legendary actions are taken at the end of another creature’s turn, and only one can be taken after each turn. Coiling Maneuver: +9 to hit (reach 5 ft.; one creature). Hit: the target must make a successful DC 16 Str saving throw or be grappled and restrained by the sea serpent. A brine serpent can have one creature grappled at a time. Concentrate Brine: The sea serpent can try to recharge its brine blast attack. Roll 1d6; the attack recharges on a roll of 5 or 6. Tail Attack: The sea serpent uses its tail attack against a target within reach.",
