        "name": "Seeping Poison",
        "desc": "If the target of the vorin’s spit attack is wearing armor, then the poison needs one round to seep through gaps in the armor and contact the target’s skin. The target or an adjacent ally can use an action to make a DC 15 Dex check; success indicates the poison was scraped off completely before it penetrated the armor. An edged weapon or tool must be used. Any slashing weapon and most piercing weapons will do the job. Note that only the vorin’s spit needs to seep through armor; poison from its sting does not."
